extends ../layout

block content
  .container.mx-auto.max-w-4xl.py-10.px-4
    h1.text-3xl.font-bold.mb-2 Refund Policy
    p.text-sm.text-gray-500.mb-8 Last updated: January 26, 2025

    // 14-Day Guarantee
    h2.text-2xl.font-semibold.mt-6.mb-3 14-Day Money-Back Guarantee
    p.mb-4 At ESL PLUS, we want you to be completely satisfied with our service. If for any reason you are not satisfied, you may request a full refund within 14 days of your purchase date.
    p.mb-4 No questions asked. No conditions or restrictions apply.

    // How to Request
    h2.text-2xl.font-semibold.mt-6.mb-3 How to Request a Refund
    p.mb-2 To request a refund, please contact us at:
    ul.list-disc.ml-6.space-y-2.mb-4
      li
        strong Email: 
        a.text-blue-600.underline(href="mailto:support@eslplus.com") support@eslplus.com
      li
        strong Subject: 
        | Refund Request
    
    p.mb-2 Please include the following information in your request:
    ul.list-disc.ml-6.space-y-2.mb-4
      li Your account email address
      li Your order number or transaction ID
      li Date of purchase
      li (Optional) Brief reason for refund request

    // Processing Time
    h2.text-2xl.font-semibold.mt-6.mb-3 Refund Processing Time
    p.mb-4 Once your refund request is received and approved, the refund will be processed within 5-7 business days.
    p.mb-4 The refund will be credited to your original payment method used for the purchase.
    p.mb-4 You will receive a confirmation email once the refund has been processed.

    // After Refund
    h2.text-2xl.font-semibold.mt-6.mb-3 What Happens After Refund
    ul.list-disc.ml-6.space-y-2.mb-4
      li Your premium membership or subscription will be cancelled immediately upon refund.
      li You will retain access to free features of ESL PLUS.
      li Any posted job listings or applications made during the subscription period will remain visible.

    // Payment Methods
    h2.text-2xl.font-semibold.mt-6.mb-3 Payment Method Specifics
    p.mb-2 Depending on your payment method, the refund may take additional time to appear:
    ul.list-disc.ml-6.space-y-2.mb-4
      li
        strong Credit/Debit Card: 
        | 3-5 business days after processing
      li
        strong PayPal: 
        | 1-2 business days after processing
      li
        strong Bank Transfer: 
        | 5-7 business days after processing

    // Contact
    h2.text-2xl.font-semibold.mt-6.mb-3 Questions or Concerns
    p.mb-4 If you have any questions about our refund policy or need assistance with a refund request, please don't hesitate to contact our support team:
    ul.list-disc.ml-6.space-y-2.mb-4
      li Email: support@eslplus.com
      li Phone: +82-31-8077-0587
      li Response time: Within 24 hours (business days)

    // Policy Changes
    h2.text-2xl.font-semibold.mt-6.mb-3 Policy Changes
    p.mb-4 We reserve the right to modify this refund policy at any time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date. Your continued use of ESL PLUS after any changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
